  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Operator’s Ledger",
    "overview": "The supplied logo and dark graphite surfaces give Ordenfi the character of an operator’s ledger: precise, composed, and assured. Dark opaque surfaces frame amounts, routes, and approvals; lime green marks the action to take, while cool information colors explain system state.\n\nHost Grotesk carries the interface and JetBrains Mono carries measured data. The reusable signature is a readable progression from request through review to wallet confirmation. Visual emphasis belongs to the operation and its amount.\n\nOne shared workspace serves / and the legacy /dashboard route: account overview above, Swap/Send/Bridge/More on the left, one assistant on the right, and activity below. Mobile stacks actions before the assistant. The active navigation entry is Workspace.\nActions use a clickable vertical sidebar on desktop, beside the selected form; on phones the same controls form a compact horizontal selector. The assistant stays on the right on desktop.",
